1
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,720
Remember, it's a surprise party for Chris.

2
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:14,880
Got it! No slip-ups, absolute secrecy.

3
00:01:15,580 --> 00:01:18,560
Did you send out all the invitations yet?

4
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:21,720
Yup, everyone's confirmed for Saturday night.

5
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:25,140
Great. Now, what about the cake situation?

6
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:28,560
I'll pick it up on Saturday afternoon.

7
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,720
Where are we hiding when he arrives?

8
00:04:53,420 --> 00:04:56,140
Everyone in the living room, lights off.

9
00:04:56,840 --> 00:05:00,080
Chris is almost home! Quick, turn off the lights!

10
00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:03,760
Wait, I hear footsteps. Is that him already?

11
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:06,660
Shh! Be super quiet, everyone.

12
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:10,080
My heart is pounding! This is intense.

13
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,980
Uh oh, he's opening the door. Get ready!

14
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:38,400
Wait, he's just looking for his keys.

15
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:42,080
Phew! That was a close call, almost busted.

16
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:45,500
He literally peered right into the room!

17
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,920
Good thing we reacted fast and froze.

18
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:52,340
Alright, false alarm. Let's reset the plan.

19
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,720
He's gone out again for groceries now.

20
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:04,140
Perfect! More time to set everything up.

21
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:07,560
Remember, no peeking when he comes back.

22
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:10,980
Got it! This surprise will be epic.

23
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:14,400
He'll never suspect a thing. Trust me.

24
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:18,080
Can't wait to see his face! So excited!

